#: scenario:scenario_88CB335D_5BA8_4A7E_BE8C_72DA907A5FA7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3da756568831ade361af7dc247c437173199a212cac396311dede616132e2db0
