msgctxt "scenario:scenario_88CB335D_5BA8_4A7E_BE8C_72DA907A5FA7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As was characteristic of the area, cloudy days and rain were frequent during this season, "
"but the sun almost always took the stage the day after a storm."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dans cette région, les nuages et la pluie étaient fréquents en cette saison, mais le soleil "
"reprenait presque toujours sa place après un orage."

#: scenario:scenario_B1972126_9191_470D_8CD6_E8E1A37076AA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54ace0faf54a638ac97d38505f30c6ec770573aba4554621ed0583e84d76d2d8
