msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ailleurs—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫au manoir,⟪k:9⟫Nellie donnait du travail "
"aux soubrettes."

#: scenario:scenario_56FADCA6_47A7_43DC_AE0D_3762B6682432
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55251f477edfc84d38a9be8a030dc9f8b39c94738c00e2572addb760d480e435
