msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hey! Who put this ugly vase here?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hé ! Qui a posé ce vase hideux ici ?!"

#: scenario:scenario_22099220_71EA_44D4_8451_2534C281178C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b98e2996e84c0bf680633a68d7bff5d7b21d4ae3dc528d7ba3258b6008fc4b4d
#. default-sha256: 4e6cdc998010cf41c8fe566f94886ae572bc92d337024422546b4e903f9efa63
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_22099220_71EA_44D4_8451_2534C281178C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie appeared to be rather irritated,⟪k:1⟫and it was the servants who bore the brunt of "
"her frustration.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Though if they found this similarly vexing, none of them showed it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie semblait assez agacée.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sa frustration retombait sur les servantes et, si "
"elles étaient vexées, du moins elles n’en laissaient rien paraître."

#: scenario:scenario_B0F5D658_7174_46B8_A984_470265C4D59B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b1344594c257f02e5c14fa9024841d7446de83e8233416254d089a48cff9396
#. default-sha256: 0df76e95384a72eaebeee10d8ee8e79d0eca69eb5df4b6de1f499f99563ebf7c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B0F5D658_7174_46B8_A984_470265C4D59B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was a girl who spoke her mind—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a trait particular to that time in history."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle était le genre de fille à dire ce qu’elle pensait—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ un trait de caractère "
"propre à cette époque."

#: scenario:scenario_9DBE7CEF_0E98_4C69_8035_7BECFBEB1317
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24dbabfbaca48b37ef98d4f4908d1551685970465f0770c81e8074930d4fafb4
#. default-sha256: 161a71e683b44d03e54758bc702530917801186236c245eb6bb754c826d50b1c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9DBE7CEF_0E98_4C69_8035_7BECFBEB1317"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Women of the Golden Age were so vivacious, in fact, that it inspired parody and satire in "
"foreign countries."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les femmes de l’⟪k:1⟫Â⟪k:2⟫ge d’Or étaient fougueuses— on en faisait même des satires et des "
"parodies à l’étranger."

#: scenario:scenario_DE2AD71D_EB41_4E77_A7F5_41BCAD4443BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b5c0f669fabebad40a6e1162ff9a39334622668f4b670b9f473e8e4aaac16e6
#. default-sha256: cf2a2f9378fc4c0dd6d8747cfb43bbddb1f284c93271fb2ae6d3476404a95f47
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DE2AD71D_EB41_4E77_A7F5_41BCAD4443BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But no matter how hands-off her parents were, had Nellie been born a generation earlier, or "
"a generation later, she likely would not have been able to act so free-spirited."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais quels que soient ses parents, si Nellie était née une génération plus tôt ou plus tard, "
"les choses auraient été très différentes et elle n’aurait pas pu agir aussi librement."

#: scenario:scenario_D1740DA2_CFCF_433A_8C24_6D6576850280
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f1b3f11443bf0fbe6a8043dbcebba8ccb5ac1a9f654bc8323683c9c199f6297
#. default-sha256: 83cc1ae61d92281181af3f9db149c630ae35737de73a4aede86ea7c1cf215492
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D1740DA2_CFCF_433A_8C24_6D6576850280"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That day, however, Nellie did not seem to be her usual self."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ce jour-là, néanmoins, Nellie ne semblait pas elle-même."

#: scenario:scenario_468503C1_9784_4B30_B1E4_062C10ED29C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe8136295440e19d0ee85c87d7e51bf404fc57fc20c23e124b3ba9f69bdf0178
#. default-sha256: fedf71e9604f7a2ed70b1ea0bdd52a3276debcc55df51df1c09dbfad72acb178
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_468503C1_9784_4B30_B1E4_062C10ED29C6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though she always spoke her mind, it rarely went beyond being childishly adorable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫D’ordinaire, elle avait beau s’exprimer librement, cela n’allait jamais au-delà du babillage "
"inoffensif."

#: scenario:scenario_953508C8_91FC_4CF5_BD8E_03E705D4C54D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96595bd565ba9250938211ac51a4b4214033b61fda201d0b0504562c137b4009
#. default-sha256: 856223949dc64b775a42b213f5b09b35fb5ac18e13054ad70688b52fe442e7cf
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_953508C8_91FC_4CF5_BD8E_03E705D4C54D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was unusual to see her in such a foul mood, not even a smile on her face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫On n’avait pas l’habitude de la voir de si mauvaise humeur au point de ne même pas se fendre "
"d’un sourire."

#: scenario:scenario_A206F73E_4111_4666_B544_2A105B09EF95
