msgctxt "scenario:scenario_52BFBD94_B392_4A83_BC32_4E754D480A62"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I go into your room all the time, Nellie.⟪k:2⟫And you were in my bedchamber just this "
"morning."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je vais tout le temps dans ta chambre, Nellie.⟪k:2⟫Et tu étais dans la mienne juste ce "
"matin."

#: scenario:scenario_D938200C_BC6D_4D44_8BDF_A50362D1F68E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea4ac2dfe084b749e5e340780ebe2879cdd74bc53eff73d394ded22e21c81a17
#. default-sha256: 5e7f5745613ae4520bb2616ec5fcf457c9cd16cf069742f81085917890a48a88
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D938200C_BC6D_4D44_8BDF_A50362D1F68E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Only one man is allowed in my bedroom, dearest Mell, and that is you. ⟪k:2⟫So unless "
"you become a servant—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫which I will not stand for—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I will not ask any of them "
"for help."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Un seul homme est autorisé à venir dans ma chambre, très cher, et c’est toi. ⟪k:2⟫"
